{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"b0d3af63-a9a8-41be-996b-2fbad379f005","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have implemented the product analytics events defined in [docs/EVENTS.md](file:///tmp/h-uzMzSf/docs/EVENTS.md) on the registration and offers screens using the existing [Analytics](file:///tmp/h-uzMzSf/lib/analytics.dart) wrapper, and documented the changes in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-uzMzSf/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **[lib/screens/registration_screen.dart](file:///tmp/h-uzMzSf/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart)**\n   - `registration_email_started`: Tracked when the user starts typing into the email field without transmitting PII.\n   - `registration_phone_started`: Tracked when the user starts typing into the phone number field without transmitting PII.\n   - `loan_amount_changed`: Tracked on `Slider.onChangeEnd` with `amount` (`int`, rounded value).\n   - `terms_accepted`: Tracked when the user checks the terms and conditions checkbox.\n   - `registration_continue_tapped`: Tracked upon pressing Continue with properties `amount` (`int`) and `terms` (`bool`).\n\n2. **[lib/screens/offer_screen.dart](file:///tmp/h-uzMzSf/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart)**\n   - `offers_scrolled`: Tracked when the user scrolls the offers list using a `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` with property `offset` (`double`, `notification.metrics.pixels`).\n\n3. **[ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-uzMzSf/ANSWER.md)**\n   - Created with a detailed description of the events implemented, their triggers, and parameters.\n","duration_seconds":88.280956,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":203960,"output_tokens":3997,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":74409,"total_tokens":207957}}}
